  "decision_summary": "Multiple close structural analogues with the same thienopyrazolopyridinone core and 4-chlorophenyl group consistently show significant brain uptake in mice, including B/P >0.3 after IP dosing and oral brain exposure. The query's cyclopropyl amide variant is expected to retain this CNS access.",
